1
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,172
Ammachi! Ammachi!

2
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:43,285
Meera? What are you doing in this empty house? Nobody's lived here for years.

3
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:47,394
Mom. This is your mother's house.

4
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:51,957
My mother died when I was a baby.

5
00:00:58,300 --> 00:00:58,450
[Engraved: Wind it backward]

6
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:05,031
Meera... wind it backward... from inside... at three.

7
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:09,538
Okay. Okay, Ammachi.

8
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:15,500
[Arjun: I heard it too. All of it. I'm coming with you.]
